 "description": "Search US registered offenders in one of two modes. Location mode: pass address or lat+lng, plus an optional radius in miles (default 1, capped at 3); results include each offender's distance from the search point. Name mode: pass at least one of first_name, last_name or dob, optionally narrowed by city/state/zipcode \u2014 those three filters alone are not accepted. Location parameters take precedence when both are supplied. Use this only for registered-offender questions; for an overall safety grade use get_crime_data instead. Results are paginated (page, limit, max 100 per page) and each page requested requires a DoorProfit API key and consumes 1 call from that key's quota.",
 "inputSchema": {
  "properties": {
   "address": {
    "description": "Full US street address, e.g. \"500 Adams St, Tulsa, OK\". Provide either address OR lat+lng.",
    "type": "string"
   },
   "city": {
    "description": "City filter for name-based searches.",
    "type": "string"
   },
   "dob": {
    "description": "Date of birth, YYYY-MM-DD.",
    "type": "string"
   },
   "first_name": {
    "description": "First name for name-based searches.",
    "type": "string"
   },
   "last_name": {
    "description": "Last name for name-based searches.",
    "type": "string"
   },
   "lat": {
    "description": "Latitude (use together with lng, as an alternative to address).",
    "type": "number"
   },
   "limit": {
    "description": "Results per page (default 50, max 100).",
    "type": "integer"
   },
   "lng": {
    "description": "Longitude (use together with lat, as an alternative to address).",
    "type": "number"
   },
   "page": {
    "description": "Page number (default 1).",
    "type": "integer"
   },
   "radius": {
    "description": "Search radius in miles for location searches (default 1, max 3).",
    "type": "number"
   },
   "state": {
    "description": "Two-letter state code filter, e.g. \"OK\".",
    "type": "string"
   },
   "zipcode": {
    "description": "Zipcode filter for name-based searches.",
    "type": "string"
   }
  },
  "type": "object"
 },
